<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Mumbai To Nagbhid Packers And Movers
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does a typical move from Mumbai to Nagbhid take?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">A standard household relocation from Mumbai to Nagbhid covers roughly 850 km and usually completes within 2 to 3 business days, depending on traffic, weather, and checkpoint clearances. Our dedicated container trucks travel on National Highway corridors with live GPS monitoring, ensuring timely delivery while maintaining the safety standards promised by a packers mover from mumbai to nagbhid chandrapur.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for an intercity shift between Mumbai and Nagbhid?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Customers need a valid government‑issued ID, original rental or ownership proof of the vehicle (if transporting a car), a signed packing agreement, and a GST invoice for corporate moves. For government or PSU reimbursements, the e‑Way bill and IBA‑approved mover code must be included. These documents streamline the process for a packers mover from mumbai to nagbhid chandrapur.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How is my furniture protected during the 850 km highway journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a 7‑layer protective packaging system that starts with high‑density bubble cushioning and multi‑ply corrugated sheets, followed by foam edge protectors, stretch film, and custom wooden crates for delicate items. Each item is securely lashed with high‑tensile ratchet straps inside our specialized container trucks, guaranteeing that your belongings arrive intact on the Mumbai‑Nagbhid route.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my shipment live while it moves from Mumbai to Nagbhid?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. All our container trucks are equipped with satellite GPS devices that provide real‑time location updates through a secure client portal. You can monitor the exact position of your cargo, receive checkpoint notifications, and get estimated arrival times, ensuring full transparency for a packers mover from mumbai to nagbhid chandrapur.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What insurance coverage is provided and how do I claim if needed?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Every shipment is covered by 100 % declared‑value insurance approved by IRDAI, protecting against loss or damage during transit. In the unlikely event of a claim, simply submit the original packing list, photos of the damaged item, and the insurance certificate to our claims team. Our process aligns with the standards of a packers mover from mumbai to nagbhid chandrapur.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Are there special considerations for moving vehicles on the Mumbai‑Nagbhid corridor?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Vehicle transport uses enclosed multi‑car trailers with hydraulic loading ramps, wheel chocks, and reinforced lashings. We conduct a pre‑move inspection, document existing conditions, and provide a separate insurance cover for automobiles. This ensures a safe, damage‑free journey for your car or two‑wheeler on the Mumbai‑to‑Nagbhid highway.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How does the cost estimate differ for household versus commercial goods?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Household moves are priced per cubic foot with optional services like packing and insurance, while commercial relocations consider weight, volume, and handling complexity. Our cost matrix clearly separates these categories, offering transparent tariffs for both. Whether you’re shifting a home or an office, the estimate reflects the expertise of a packers mover from mumbai to nagbhid chandrapur.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
